WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.880
(Episode 98) The Curtis family is terrible.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.520
One daughter was a substitute bride,

3
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.100
while the other hired a man to kill someone.

4
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.300
And their father

5
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.160
actually has the nerve to spread rumors

6
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.340
that Mr. Bradley likes Noemi everywhere.

7
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.240
He's taking advantage of Mr. Bradley's connections

8
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.440
to make a profit for himself.

9
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.740
Mr. Bradley is unlucky

10
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.700
to have gotten involved with them.

11
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:20.940
But it would be great if Miss Hall

12
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.540
and Mr. Bradley could be together.

13
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.940
With Miss Hall around,

14
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.060
the Curtis family will not

15
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.760
dare say that Mr. Bradley likes Noemi.

16
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.960
Your information

17
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.120
is out of date.

18
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.860
I heard that

19
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.780
Oliver was arrested two days ago.

20
00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.160
From now on, he will no longer

21
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.100
be able to flatter Niko.

22
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.680
How do you know? And who are you?

23
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.160
You seemed to know a lot about the Curtis family.

24
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.240
I thought you knew who I was.

25
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.180
I am Noemi,

26
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.500
Niko's ex-wife.

27
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.480
Oh, you are Noemi?

28
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.640
This wine is quite strong.

29
00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:25.940
What is she doing?

30
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.480
She's not replying to my messages.

31
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:28.860
What are you doing?
